      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为有你在这里，\r\n这场比赛才能如此激烈……\r\n这胜利才会如此耀眼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffca2f48c39304f0a26e2748bcf9519acb73bd18f0ec8bf1a30739c3ca23fa0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
