      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c474ac298055cad3c8446d37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "友人陪在身侧，前辈支撑后背，\r\n全世界的目光都集中于这场比赛——\r\n也许，新生的新宇宙会在那儿成为完全态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffe4fc71ce980c0e6f1b9a56ee09e8009588a495bdecb813ae1a22b20d885f40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
